# Self-host

Full skill: `docs/skills/self-host.md`

- `Dockerfile` multi-stage, `NITRO_PRESET=node-server`, `VITE_AUTH_ENABLED=false`.
- Optional runtime `XAI_API_KEY`. Never bake secrets into the image.
- `docker compose up -d --build`. Rebuild after model/tape changes.
- No Postgres. Paper state stays in the browser.
